</script></span> </div>
                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><FONT face=Simsun><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">校服是学校团队精神的直接体现，更是学校特色文化的承载与展示。校服作为一种校园文化符号，创设的是一种优美的环境氛围，传递的是一种对于美的认识与理解。统一的校服将能帮助学生确立平等、民主的意识，优雅的校服则能帮助学生修炼阳光、书卷的气质。校服又是学生身份的象征，是一个学校学生管理与学生精神风貌的体现，为使校服穿着规范化、日常化，学校特制定如下管理规定：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><FONT face=Simsun>一、着装要求<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 33.85pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.82; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>1</SPAN><FONT face=Simsun><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">．学生进校园及在校期间必须穿着校服（</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">包括周日住校生返校及晚自修期间</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">）。学生可根据季节气候的变化决定穿着哪款校服。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 33.85pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.82; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>2</SPAN><FONT face=Simsun><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">．规范穿着各套校服，佩戴相应校徽。（</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">备注：不规范穿着情况，如：校服穿里面，外面穿其他服装；校服拉链不拉，或者扣子不扣，里面穿其他服装；上身穿校服，下身配其他裤子等等</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">）<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 33.85pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.82; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><FONT face=Simsun>．升旗仪式、重大主题教育活动等须统一规范穿着学校规定校服<SPAN lang=EN-US>---</SPAN>正装。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 33.85pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.82; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>4</SPAN><FONT face=Simsun><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">．学生以学校名义集体外出参加的各类教育教学活动，必须穿着统一校服。组织者要严格管理。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><FONT face=Simsun>二、爱护要求<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 33.85pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.82; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><FONT face=Simsun>．学生要爱惜校服，保持校服整洁。养成良好的穿着、保护、洗涤、存放习惯。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 33.85pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.82; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><FONT face=Simsun>．不得在校服上吊挂饰物，不得在校服上写字或涂画。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 33.85pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.82; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>3</SPAN><FONT face=Simsun><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">．校服损毁或丢失，高二高三学生</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">可直接联系舒浩服饰厂家购买，学校代码为：<SPAN lang=EN-US>67378</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">；<SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">高一学生可直接联系有美、乔顺校服商城，学校代码为：<SPAN lang=EN-US>8092496735</SPAN>。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P></SPAN></FONT>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 33.85pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.82; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><FONT face=Simsun><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"></SPAN></FONT><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>4</SPAN><FONT face=Simsun><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">．严禁转借校服给校外人员穿着。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><FONT face=Simsun>三、管理监督<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 33.85pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.82; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><FONT face=Simsun>．班主任具体管理本班学生校服穿着。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 33.85pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.82; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><FONT face=Simsun>．年段长负责本年段学生校服穿着的检查、教育工作。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 33.85pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.82; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><FONT face=Simsun>．德育处对学生穿着校服工作进行检查，纳入班级文明礼仪考核。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '仿宋_GB2312','serif'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><FONT face=Simsun>四、检查考评<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
